{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchurHook","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchurHook","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.RSSYTSchur","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.SchurPrincipalBetaForm"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.hook_mul_bsum_principal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.hook_mul_bsum_principal","kind":"theorem","line":254,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PrincipalSchurHook.lean#L254-L263","doc":"**The same, for the bounded tableau sum.**  Reverse semistandard tableaux of shape `μ` with\nentries `< N`, weighted by `Q^{|T|}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.hook_mul_schur_principal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.hook_mul_schur_principal","kind":"theorem","line":188,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PrincipalSchurHook.lean#L188-L252","doc":"**The hook-content formula at the principal point, division-free.**\n\n`∏_c (1 − Q^{h(c)}) · s_μ(1, Q, …, Q^{N−1}) = Q^{e(μ)} · ∏_{i<N} ∏_{t<μ_i} (1 − Q^{N−i+t})`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.rowLen_bot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.rowLen_bot","kind":"theorem","line":183,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PrincipalSchurHook.lean#L183-L186","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.descFactF_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.descFactF_add","kind":"theorem","line":174,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PrincipalSchurHook.lean#L174-L181","doc":"`descFactF f (a + b) = descFactF f a · ∏_{t<b} f(a+1+t)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.alt_principal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.alt_principal","kind":"theorem","line":140,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PrincipalSchurHook.lean#L140-L172","doc":"**The alternant at the principal point, factored.**\n\n`a_{α^μ}(1, Q, …, Q^{N−1}) = C_N · Q^{e(μ)} · ∏_{i<j<N} (1 − Q^{β_i − β_j})`, with\n`C_N = ∏_{j<N} (−Q^{N−1−j})^j` independent of `μ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.eExp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.eExp","kind":"def","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PrincipalSchurHook.lean#L137-L138","doc":"`e(μ) = ∑_{j<N} j · μ_j`, the exponent the principal specialisation carries. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.alt_pow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.alt_pow","kind":"theorem","line":128,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PrincipalSchurHook.lean#L128-L135","doc":"**The alternant at `x_i = Qⁱ` is a Vandermonde.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.prod_pairs_snd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.prod_pairs_snd","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PrincipalSchurHook.lean#L109-L124","doc":"A pair product depending only on the larger index is a power product. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.prod_pairs_reverse","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.prod_pairs_reverse","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PrincipalSchurHook.lean#L85-L107","doc":"Reversing both indices, `(i, j) ↦ (N−1−j, N−1−i)`, permutes the pairs. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.prod_Ioi_eq_prod_pairs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.prod_Ioi_eq_prod_pairs","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PrincipalSchurHook.lean#L63-L83","doc":"A `Fin N` pair product over `Ioi`, as a product over `pairs N`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.prod_range_eq_prod_pairs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.prod_range_eq_prod_pairs","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PrincipalSchurHook.lean#L50-L61","doc":"The corpus spelling of a pair product, `∏_{i<N} ∏_{k<N−(i+1)} g(i, i+1+k)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.mem_pairs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.mem_pairs","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PrincipalSchurHook.lean#L45-L48","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.pairs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PrincipalSchur.pairs","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PrincipalSchurHook.lean#L42-L43","doc":"The pairs `i < j < N`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}